{"title": "The Scourge Mistress' Bane", "pageid": 27968, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Scourge_Mistress'_Bane", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>The Scourge Mistress' Bane</b> is a passive feature that can apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\">Bane</a> but will hurt the wielder if they are too healthy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Chance to inflict upon the target a 1d4 penalty to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>. If the attacker still has 50% or more <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a>, they take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> themselves. \n</p><p>A Baned creature receives a 1d4 penalty to Attack Rolls and Saving Throws.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bane\"> Condition: Bane </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\">Bane</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>-1d4</b> penalty to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Axe\" title=\"Ritual Axe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Axe\" title=\"Ritual Axe\">Ritual Axe</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\">Bane</a> condition applied by this weapon is the same as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(spell)\" title=\"Bane (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/30px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(spell)\" title=\"Bane (spell)\">Bane</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> spell and does not stack.</li>\n<li>Because of the bug listed below, the Battle Master Fighter's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweeping_Attack\" title=\"Sweeping Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sweeping Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Sweeping_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sweeping_Attack\" title=\"Sweeping Attack\">Sweeping Attack</a> applies this debuff to every target within the cone's area of effect, hit or miss.</li>\n<li>Many situations increase the self-damage dealt by this passive feature:\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Attacker\" title=\"Savage Attacker\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/20px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/30px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/40px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Savage Attacker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/20px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Attacker\" title=\"Savage Attacker\">Savage Attacker</a> feat results in secondary damage being re-rolled higher.</li>\n<li>A critical hit with this axe doubles the self-damage.</li>\n<li>Some damage riders such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a>, radiant damage from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\">Callous Glow Ring</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Overload\" title=\"Psionic Overload\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/20px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/30px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Overload\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/20px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Overload\" title=\"Psionic Overload\">Psionic Overload</a> increase the self-damage.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Effects which reduce incoming piercing damage reduce the self-inflicted damage.\n<ul><li>However, as the self-damage is classified as magical, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour_Master\" title=\"Heavy Armour Master\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/20px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/30px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/40px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Armour Master\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/20px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour_Master\" title=\"Heavy Armour Master\">Heavy Armour Master</a> damage reduction does not apply.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If at 50% health or higher, the wielder suffers self-damage even if the target dies from the axe blow.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>While the item description says 'chance,' <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(spell)\" title=\"Bane (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/38px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/50px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(spell)\" title=\"Bane (spell)\">Bane</a> is always inflicted on a hit.</li>\n<li>If the wielder of this axe is at 50% health or higher and they use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Non-Lethal Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\">Non-Lethal Damage</a> to knock out an enemy with it, they will also be knocked out, even if at full HP.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4667/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43375/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18380/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 993184/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   86.861      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   86.861      1 -total\n 31.68%   27.519     14 Template:Icon_text\n 29.92%   25.993     12 Template:Icon_link\n 28.27%   24.558     48 Template:Trim\n 21.88%   19.008      1 Template:PageSeo\n 21.53%   18.698      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.11%   13.995      4 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 16.03%   13.924      1 Template:Cond\n 15.69%   13.627      3 Template:SmCond\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27968-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202855 and revision id 388431. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}